# Risk Ranking Skill
## Purpose
Generate prioritized equipment risk list for targeted maintenance.
## When to Use
Weekly maintenance scheduling operations.
## Required Inputs
Trained logistic regression model and operational device records.
## Files Used
data/equipment_data.csv, final_report.qmd
## Method
Model response prediction (`predict(..., type = "response")`) and sorting (`order()`).
## Procedure
Run risk code chunk in final_report.qmd.
## Validation
Verify output probabilities fall strictly between 0.0 and 1.0.
## Output
Top 10 priority queue dataframe with device ID, type, and failure risk score.
## Interpretation
Directly guides technician dispatch to highest-risk clinical assets.
## Limitation
Static predictions based on historical logs without live streaming sensor updates.